  "limitations": [
    "Time of day was not controlled, which might influence results.",
    "Only illuminance level was varied; other lighting variables (e.g., uniformity, colour temperature) were kept constant, limiting a comprehensive understanding of human responses to VR-based lighting environments.",
    "Only one classroom design was used, so results might not generalize to different classroom designs.",
    "VR might induce students to focus more on enjoying the experience rather than task performance.",
    "The presence of other students and different viewpoint positions within the classroom were excluded due to parameterization difficulties, potentially influencing task performance."
  ],
